IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PROMPTCACHE-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PREFIX-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONCURRENT-STREAMS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PROMPTCACHE-V2.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0 OR PREFIX-TOKENS == 0 OR CONCURRENT-STREAMS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 5600 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 CONCURRENT-STREAMS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
